{"id":"rempli","lemma":"rempli","pos":"adj","rank":1702,"glosses":["filled","filled (having another tincture than its own covering the greater part)"],"ipa":"/ʁɑ̃.pli/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/04/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-rempli.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-rempli.wav.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"remplie","masculinePlural":"remplis","femininePlural":"remplies"},"formAudio":{"remplis":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/64/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-remplis.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Les enfants ont rempli la pièce.","en":"Children filled the room.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},null,{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room in a house, etc."}]},{"text":"La bouteille est remplie d'eau.","en":"The bottle is filled with water.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"bottle"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"water"}]},{"text":"Le ciel est rempli d'étoiles.","en":"The sky is full of stars.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"sky"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"star","l":"étoile"}]},{"text":"Lundi était une journée bien remplie.","en":"Monday was a busy day.","words":[{"g":"Monday"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"day"},{"g":"well"},null]},{"text":"Mon cœur était rempli de joie.","en":"My heart was filled with joy.","words":[{"g":"my"},{"g":"heart"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"joy"}]}]}